body	O	7ee22562	## 책임\nItemStore 가 소유하는 표 묶음. 세부 클래스는 이것을 reference 로 받는다 (개발수칙 4.19). 버전 표 (names · versions · tag_versions) 가 파일 내용이고, 나머지는 거기서 만든 현재 뷰다.\n\n타입: ItemCapacity, ItemTables\n\n## 모듈 인터페이스\n```cpp\n// struct ItemTables\nexplicit ItemTables(const ItemCapacity& capacity) : names(capacity.versions), versions(capacity.versions), tag_versions(capacity.tag_versions), items(capacity.items), id_index(capacity.items), key_index(capacity.items), keys(capacity.items, entity::NO_KEY), parents(capacity.items, entity::NO_KEY), tags(capacity.tags), order(capacity.versions), bodies(capacity.body_bytes, capacity.versions);\n```\n\n## 멤버 변수\n```cpp\n// ItemCapacity\nsize_t items;\nsize_t tags;\nsize_t versions;\nsize_t tag_versions;\nsize_t body_bytes;\n// ItemTables\nFixedMap<uint32_t, entity::IdText> names;\nVersionTable<entity::ItemVersion> versions;\nVersionTable<entity::TagVersion> tag_versions;\nLazyPool<entity::ItemRecord> items;\nFixedMap<entity::IdText, uint32_t> id_index;\nFixedMap<uint32_t, uint32_t> key_index;\nstd::vector<uint32_t> keys;\nstd::vector<uint32_t> parents;\nstd::vector<entity::TagRecord> tags;\nsize_t tag_count {0};\nstd::vector<uint32_t> order;\nBodyStore bodies;\n```\n\n## 의존 모듈\n- DSN-023 FixedMap\n- DSN-027 LazyPool\n- DSN-038 VersionTable\n- DSN-045 BodyStore\n- DSN-058 item_records\n- DSN-061 version_records\n
