body	O	81354d90	## 책임\nContext 가 소유한 store 와 모델 표를 usecase 에 빌려주는 참조 묶음.\n\n## 모듈 인터페이스\n```cpp\n// struct Workspace\nKiottySpecStatus reload();\nKiottySpecStatus refresh();\nKiottySpecStatus finish(KiottySpecStatus status);\nResult<entity::ItemHandle, KiottySpecStatus> resolve(Span<const char> id);\n```\n\n## 멤버 변수\n```cpp\n// Workspace\nSpecFile& file;\nFailure& failure;\nconst ModelCatalog& catalog;\nMetaStore& meta;\nCheckpointStore& checkpoints;\nItemStore& items;\nRelationStore& relations;\nDecisionStore& decisions;\n```\n\n## 의존 모듈\n- DSN-022 Failure\n- DSN-035 text_view\n- DSN-046 CheckpointStore\n- DSN-048 DecisionStore\n- DSN-051 ItemStore\n- DSN-055 MetaStore\n- DSN-056 RelationStore\n- DSN-065 ModelCatalog\n- DSN-068 SpecFile\n
body	O	81639d02	```cpp\nusing ServerResult = Result<ServerHandle, ErrorCode>;\n\nServerResult createServer(Context& context, const ServerConfiguration& configuration)\n{\n    Handle handle = context.servers.acquire();\n    if (!handle.valid()) { return ServerResult::failure(ErrorCode::POOL_IS_FULL); }\n\n    auto server = context.servers.get(handle);\n    if (!server) { return ServerResult::failure(server.code); }\n\n    ErrorCode code = server.value.initialize(configuration);\n    if (code != ErrorCode::SUCCESS) { return ServerResult::failure(code); }\n\n    return ServerResult::success(handle);\n}\n```\n
